# Agent tool state written into the tree by developer tooling: plans,
# notepads, scratch evidence. Not part of the source tree, and it carries
# operator home paths that should not be in a public repository.
#
# Two names for the same thing -- ignore both, because scanning for one and
# stopping is how the other survives.
.omo/
.sisyphus/
